      "description": "Database connections the registry pods hold between them: in use, and the most they may open. \"Acquiring\" counts requests that are getting a connection at the moment of the scrape, whether they wait for a free one or for a new one to open. If it stays above 0 while \"In use\" is near the limit, the pool is too small for the load; if \"In use\" is low, opening connections is slow.",
